## Earthquakes of a week: the USGS feed of magnitude 2.5 and up, saved
## 2026-10-06 (demos/data/PROVENANCE.txt), checked against its SHA-256,
## into SQLite; SQL selects and groups, X_eTaL computes (the
## magnitude-frequency law), pictures show it.
## Run: just demo http quakes   (pictures go to work/draw/; the live
## feed: just live-quakes)

"dg:" u_se< "Digest"
"se:" u_se< "Seismic"

csv := "demos/data/quakes-2.5-week.csv"
"the saved copy is unchanged (its SHA-256 matches):"
(dg:s_ha256File csv) m_atch "80454e4268b6ed6f2a5e448038303e4a2a994012d445f3e2efc3da2c825173c5"
se:r_eport csv
